{"step_index":258,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:30:15Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the User's Request**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the user's request. My focus is on understanding the requirements for scanning and importing data sheets. I'm taking a close look at the provided examples to discern the structure and relevant data fields for dialing and notation.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI've moved on to solidify the data structures. I'm focusing on the images, parsing each field in detail. My goal is to accurately represent the information in each file. I need to capture the specific needs of the client regarding FRS retirement, alongside the data sheet import functionalities. I am also working on the data field extractions, trying to match fields from both images.\n\n\n**Extracting Specific Details**\n\nI'm now extracting key details from this section. I see an email address, the number of years working in the Florida Retirement System, and the user's self-assessment of their FRS knowledge. I'm also noting the checked options indicating their interest in learning more, a guaranteed interest plan, and better understanding their current savings. I'm taking this data as user input to assist with the next step.\n\n\n**Defining Meeting Preferences**\n\nI'm now concentrating on the meeting preference data. I've extracted the structured format for specifying availability, including the day and time ranges. I recognize this as a key component for scheduling and am eager to integrate this into the workflow. I need to handle this information for the user for quick reference, but I also need to make it visible, and editable.\n\n\n**Interpreting User Interests**\n\nI'm now diving into the user's interests as expressed through checkboxes and knowledge level. Specifically, I'm parsing the array of strings indicating various FRS-related interests, as well as the string for custom questions. I will leverage this information to tailor the interactions. Additionally, I'm examining their stated FRS knowledge level to adjust my approach.\n\n\n**Visualizing Key Data**\n\nI'm now visualizing how the HUD screen will look when an agent connects with Joseph Adona. I have the school, FRS data, interests, and availability, and I'm crafting the SMS template for auto-personalization. It will be for ValuTeachers and FRS.\nI need to customize the entire application. I'm exploring the implementation requirements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":true,"Summary":"Implementation plan to customize SnapDialer specifically for ValuTeachers & Florida Retirement System (FRS) cards, including full schema extraction for FRS knowledge level, DROP interests, 403(b)/457(b) contributions, meeting time preferences, and tailored ValuTeachers HUD & SMS templates.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# ValuTeachers & Florida Retirement System (FRS) Customization Plan\n\nTransform SnapDialer into a specialized **ValuTeachers & FRS Retirement Prospecting Power App**, tailor-made for scanning **ValuTeachers Report Cards** and **National Life Group / ValuTeachers Free Retirement Analysis Cards**.\n\n## User Review Required\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The app is now strictly tailored to ValuTeachers & FRS educators. The AI Vision Engine, SQLite schema, Dialer HUD, and SMS Templates will now automatically extract, store, and present all specific educator fields:\n> - **Educator Details:** School, Room #, Planning Period, FRS Years of Service, Age / DOB, Salary, Paychecks/Yr, Text Ok (Y/N).\n> - **FRS Knowledge Level:** (e.g. *Not very much*, *I know a little*, *Very well*).\n> - **Specific FRS & 403(b) Interests:** D.R.O.P., 403(b)/457(b) annuities, Guaranteed interest + 5% bonus, Permanent life insurance, State pension analysis, Rollovers.\n> - **Educator's Questions:** \"I have a question about: ...\"\n> - **Best Meeting Availability (1st, 2nd, 3rd choices):** (e.g. *1. Mon 1-2 PM, 2. Wed 1-2 PM, 3. Fri 1-2 PM*).\n\n---\n\n## Proposed Changes\n\n### 1. Data Layer & Types\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/types/index.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/types/index.ts)\n- Add ValuTeachers / FRS fields to `Lead` and `ExtractedLeadItem`:\n  - `school`: string\n  - `age`: string\n  - `planning_period`: string\n  - `room_number`: string\n  - `years_in_frs`: string\n  - `text_ok`: boolean\n  - `frs_knowledge`: string ('Not very much' | 'I know a little' | 'Very well')\n  - `frs_interests`: string[] (e.g. DROP, 403b, Guaranteed 5% bonus, Life insurance)\n  - `custom_questions`: string\n  - `meeting_preferences`: string[] (1st, 2nd, 3rd preferred meeting times)\n  - `annual_salary`: string\n  - `present_403b_contribution`: string\n\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/db/database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts)\n- Update SQLite table definition for `leads` to include columns for all ValuTeachers & FRS fields.\n- Seed pre-loaded realistic ValuTeachers demo leads matching the uploaded sample sheets (e.g. `Joseph Adona` at `VOL`).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Specialized ValuTeachers Gemini Vision AI Extractor\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts)\n- Update the system instructions and structured `responseSchema` to specifically recognize:\n  - **ValuTeachers Report Cards** and **National Life Group FRS Analysis Cards**.\n  - Extract checked boxes, circled FRS knowledge levels, handwritten meeting preferences, planning periods, school names, and years in FRS.\n  - Automatically format `frs_interests` tags and format `meeting_preferences`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. ValuTeachers Dialer HUD Experience\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)\n- Re-architect the contact card in the HUD:\n  - **Top Banner:** School Badge (e.g. `🏫 Volusia County / VOL`) + `Room #` / `Planning Period`.\n  - **FRS Profile Ribbon:** `9 Yrs in FRS` | `Age: 42` | `FRS Knowledge: \"Knows a little\"`.\n  - **Hot Button / Interests Tags:** Highlight checked interests (e.g. 🎯 *Wants to know about 403(b)*, 💰 *Guaranteed + 5% Bonus*, 🛡️ *Permanent Life Insurance*, ⏳ *D.R.O.P.*).\n  - **Meeting Availability Callout:** Highlights preferred callback times (*1. Mon 1-2 PM, 2. Wed 1-2 PM, 3. Fri 1-2 PM*) right above the Call button so the agent knows exact open slots!\n\n---\n\n### 4. Tailored ValuTeachers SMS Templates & Cadences\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/db/cadenceRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/cadenceRepository.ts)\n- Pre-seed specialized ValuTeachers follow-up SMS templates:\n  - **Template 1 (Meeting Slot Confirmation):** *\"Hi {{name}}, this is {{my_name}} with ValuTeachers. I received your FRS Report Card from {{school}}. I see you're available {{meeting_pref}} to review your Florida State Retirement & 403(b) options. Does that time still work for you?\"*\n  - **Template 2 (No Answer Follow-Up):** *\"Hi {{name}}, {{my_name}} from ValuTeachers here! Tried catching you regarding your FRS retirement questions. Let me know if during your planning period works best for a quick 5-min chat!\"*\n  - **Template 3 (D.R.O.P. & Pension Review):** *\"Hi {{name}}, regarding your {{years_in_frs}} years in FRS and your retirement analysis request, when is a good day to connect?\"*\n\n---\n\n### 5. Verification Table & Lead Detail Screen\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx)\n- Update the tabular lead verification review to display and edit School, Years in FRS, FRS Knowledge, Interests, and Preferred Meeting Times.\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)\n- Update the Lead Profile Screen with a full \"ValuTeachers / FRS Report Card\" section.\n\n---\n\n## Verification Plan\n\n### Automated Verification\n- Verify database migrations and schema consistency on both SQLite and Web local storage.\n- Test Vision JSON extraction schema against the exact fields from `Joseph Adona`'s report card.\n\n### Manual Verification\n1. Test scanning / loading `Joseph Adona` sample data.\n2. Confirm that School (`VOL`), Cell (`386-212-3234`), Email (`jradona@volusia.k12.fl.us`), Years in FRS (`9`), Age (`42`), FRS Knowledge (`Knows a little`), and Preferred Times (`Mon 1-2 PM, Wed 1-2 PM, Fri 1-2 PM`) all display accurately in the HUD.\n3. Test 1-tap SMS with auto-interpolated ValuTeachers FRS meeting confirmation.\n","Description":"ValuTeachers and Florida Retirement System customization plan","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\implementation_plan.md","toolAction":"Writing ValuTeachers implementation plan","toolSummary":"Write implementation_plan.md for ValuTeachers"}}]}
