{"step_index":260,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:30:28Z","content":"I have analyzed the two sample data sheets (**ValuTeachers Report Card** and **National Life Group / ValuTeachers Free Retirement Analysis Form**) and created a tailored implementation plan.\n\n### Summary of What Will Be Customized for ValuTeachers:\n1. **Full Educator Profile Extraction:**\n   - **School / District** (e.g. `VOL / Volusia County`), **Room #**, and **Planning Period**.\n   - **Years in Florida Retirement System (FRS)**, **Age / DOB**, and **Text Ok (Y/N)** status.\n2. **FRS Knowledge & Hot-Button Questions:**\n   - Detects circled FRS Understanding (*Not very much*, *I know a little*, *Very well*).\n   - Detects all checked boxes (e.g. *D.R.O.P.*, *403(b)/457(b) annuities*, *Guaranteed interest + 5% bonus*, *Permanent life insurance*, *Pension analysis*, *Tax reduction*).\n   - Captures specific questions written by the educator.\n3. **Meeting Preferences (1st, 2nd, 3rd Choice Time Slots):**\n   - Extracts handwritten availability (e.g. `1. Mon 1-2 PM`, `2. Wed 1-2 PM`, `3. Fri 1-2 PM`).\n4. **ValuTeachers HUD & 1-Tap SMS Auto-Personalization:**\n   - In the Power Dialer HUD, all educator FRS hot-buttons and preferred meeting times appear right above the Dial button.\n   - 1-Tap SMS templates automatically pre-fill: *\"Hi Joseph, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from VOL. I see you're available Mon 1-2 PM to review your Florida State Retirement & 403(b) options...\"*\n\nPlease review the [`implementation_plan.md`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3/implementation_plan.md) and click **Proceed** or let me know if you would like any adjustments before I start building!"}
